BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (notifications, including planned maintenance announcements, certificate expiry warnings and API) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (key expiry warnings.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (3. Signing in and single sign-on) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 668 Td (3.1 Local accounts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 646 Td (Users can sign in with a local TesseraCloud account \(email address and password\). Local) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633 Td (accounts require multi-factor authentication with an authenticator app; SMS one-time codes are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 620 Td (not offered for sign-in. Passwords must be at least 12 characters. An idle web session expires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 607 Td (after 30 minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 584 Td (3.2 SAML 2.0 single sign-on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 562 Td (TesseraCloud supports SAML 2.0 single sign-on with any compliant identity provider. Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 549 Td (has tested Microsoft Entra ID, Okta and Ping Identity. To configure SSO, a Tenant Owner goes to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 536 Td (Settings > Security > Single Sign-On and enters the identity provider metadata URL or uploads) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 523 Td (the metadata XML.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 501 Td (Values to give your identity provider team:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (- Service provider entity ID: urn:tesseracloud:tenant:{tenantId}, for example) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (   urn:tesseracloud:tenant:TC-T-004817.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 453 Td (- Assertion consumer service \(ACS\) URL:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 440 Td (   https://login.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com/saml/acs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 427 Td (- NameID format: email address.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 414 Td (- Optional attribute "tc_role" to assign a role at sign-in; if absent, new users receive the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 401 Td (   Viewer role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 388 Td (Once SSO is enforced \(the "Require SSO" switch\), local passwords stop working for all users) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 375 Td (except designated break-glass accounts. At least one Tenant Owner must remain as a break-glass) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 362 Td (local account so that the tenant can be recovered if the identity provider is unavailable.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 339 Td (3.3 SCIM provisioning \(Enterprise\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 317 Td (Enterprise tenants can provision and deprovision users automatically using SCIM 2.0. The SCIM) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 304 Td (base URL is https://api.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com/scim/v2 and it authenticates with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291 Td (a dedicated SCIM token generated at Settings > Security > SCIM. Deprovisioned users are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 278 Td (deactivated immediately and deleted after 30 days.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 253 Td (4. Roles and permissions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 231 Td (TesseraCloud uses five fixed roles. Roles can be granted tenant-wide or restricted to specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218 Td (sites.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 197 Td (Role | Typical user | Key permissions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 185 Td (Tenant Owner | Customer IT or reliability lead | All permissions, including SSO, billing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 173 Td (contacts, API keys, support access and tenant deletion) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 161 Td (Site Admin | Site maintenance manager | Manage sites, assets, gateways, nodes, alarm policies) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 149 Td (and site users within assigned sites) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 137 Td (Analyst | Reliability engineer | View all data, create dashboards and reports, acknowledge) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 125 Td (alarms, run exports) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 113 Td (Viewer | Operator or manager | View dashboards, assets and alarms; cannot acknowledge alarms) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 101 Td (Integrator | Service account for integrations | API access only through API keys; no web) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 89 Td (sign-in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 67 Td (Custom roles are not supported. A user may hold different roles on different sites; the most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 54 Td (permissive applicable role applies to tenant-wide objects.) Tj ET
endstream
