BT /F1 9 Tf 54 730 Td (SMS | Enterprise only | 1,000 messages per month included; additional messages billed quarterly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 718 Td (Mobile push | Standard, Enterprise | Tessera mobile app, iOS and Android) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 696 Td (Channels are configured at Settings > Notifications > Channels. Webhook deliveries are retried) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 683 Td (up to 6 times with exponential back-off over approximately 1 hour. Webhook deliveries do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 670 Td (count towards API rate limits.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 645 Td (9. Data retention and downsampling) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 622 Td (9.1 Retention periods) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 600 Td (Raw readings are retained according to the subscription plan:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 578 Td (- Standard: 13 months of raw readings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 565 Td (- Enterprise: 36 months of raw readings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 552 Td (After the raw retention period, readings are not simply deleted. They are downsampled into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 539 Td (hourly aggregates \(minimum, maximum, mean and 95th percentile for each metric\) which are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 526 Td (retained for 7 years. Alarm history and acknowledgement records are retained for 7 years on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 513 Td (both plans.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 490 Td (9.2 Configuring downsampling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 468 Td (Some customers prefer to downsample earlier, for example to reduce the volume of data exposed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 455 Td (to integrations. The setting is at Settings > Sites > Data Retention > Downsampling. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 442 Td (options are:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (- Plan default \(13 or 36 months, as above\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (- Downsample after 6 months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 394 Td (- Downsample after 3 months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (The raw retention period can be shortened but never extended beyond the plan maximum. Changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (take effect at the next nightly retention job, which runs at 02:00 UTC in the tenant's hosting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (region. Shortening retention is irreversible for data already downsampled.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 330 Td (10. API keys and integrations) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 307 Td (10.1 Creating API keys) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 285 Td (API keys are created at Settings > Integrations > API Keys by a Tenant Owner. Each key is bound) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 272 Td (to either a named user or an Integrator service account and has one or more scopes:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 251 Td (Scope | Allows) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 239 Td (devices:read | List and read gateways and nodes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 227 Td (devices:write | Rename devices, change reporting intervals) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 215 Td (readings:read | Read readings and aggregates) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 203 Td (alarms:read | Read alarms and alarm history) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 191 Td (alarms:write | Acknowledge alarms) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 179 Td (exports:write | Create bulk export jobs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 167 Td (webhooks:write | Manage webhook subscriptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 145 Td (The key secret is shown once at creation. A tenant can have at most 20 active API keys.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 122 Td (10.2 Rotation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 100 Td (API keys have a mandatory maximum lifetime of 365 days. Tenant Owners receive an email warning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 87 Td (30 days and again 7 days before a key expires. To rotate a key without downtime, create a new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (key with the same scopes, deploy it to the integration, then revoke the old key. Revoked keys) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 61 Td (stop working within 60 seconds.) Tj ET
endstream
