BT /F2 11 Tf 54 719 Td (10.3 Rate limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 697 Td (API requests are rate-limited per tenant according to plan. Current limits, headers and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 684 Td (back-off guidance are in the TesseraCloud API Rate Limits document) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 671 Td (\(prod-tesseracloud-api-rate-limits-v2\). Endpoint details are in the TesseraCloud REST API) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 658 Td (Reference \(prod-tesseracloud-api-reference\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 633 Td (11. Device certificates and re-provisioning) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 610 Td (11.1 How devices authenticate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 588 Td (Each TS-4 gateway authenticates to TesseraCloud with an X.509 device certificate issued by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 575 Td (Tessera device certificate authority when the gateway is claimed. Gateway certificates are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 562 Td (valid for 3 years. Nodes do not hold their own certificates; they are authenticated to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 549 Td (gateway by the mesh network key.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 527 Td (TesseraCloud renews gateway certificates automatically 60 days before expiry, provided the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514 Td (gateway is online and running firmware 5.2.0 or later. Gateways on 5.1.x cannot auto-renew and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 501 Td (must be updated first.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 478 Td (11.2 Expired or invalid certificates \(T-327\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 456 Td (If a gateway certificate expires, for example because the gateway was offline or in storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 443 Td (during the renewal window, the gateway can no longer connect. It reports T-327 \(device) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 430 Td (certificate expired\) in its local event log, its status LED flashes red, and TesseraCloud shows) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 417 Td (it as Offline. The gateway continues to buffer readings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395 Td (To re-provision the certificate:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 373 Td (1. In TesseraCloud, go to Fleet > Gateways > [gateway] > Security > Re-provision Certificate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 360 Td (   You need the Site Admin role for the gateway's site, or Tenant Owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347 Td (2. TesseraCloud generates a one-time provisioning token \(12 characters, grouped as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 334 Td (   XXXX-XXXX-XXXX\). The token is valid for 24 hours and can be used once.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 321 Td (3. Connect a laptop to the gateway's SVC port and open the local interface at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 308 Td (   https://192.168.50.1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 295 Td (4. Go to System > Cloud > Provisioning Token, enter the token and select Apply.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282 Td (5. The gateway requests a new certificate, reconnects, and uploads its buffered readings. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 269 Td (   LED returns to solid green within about 3 minutes.) Tj ET
