BT /F1 10 Tf 54 243 Td (error of more than 24 hours causes certificate validation to fail. If the gateway is on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 230 Td (firmware 5.1.x, update it locally to 5.3.0 before re-provisioning, because the provisioning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 217 Td (token page does not exist in 5.1.x.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 194 Td (11.3 Revoking a certificate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 172 Td (If a gateway is lost or stolen, revoke its certificate immediately at Fleet > Gateways >) Tj ET
