BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (While maintenance mode is active:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 707 Td (- Readings continue to be recorded and are flagged "maintenance" in exports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 694 Td (- Alarm policies are not evaluated and no notifications are sent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (- Gateway offline notifications are suppressed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (Maintenance mode has a maximum duration of 72 hours per activation. When it expires, alarm) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655 Td (evaluation resumes automatically; a new activation must be started if the work continues. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 642 Td (limit is deliberate, to avoid assets being left unmonitored indefinitely. Each activation and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 629 Td (expiry is recorded in the audit log with the user who started it and the reason entered.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 604 Td (13. Audit log) Tj ET
