BT /F1 10 Tf 54 569 Td (role changes, API key creation and revocation, SSO changes, alarm policy changes, gateway) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (transfers, certificate operations, maintenance mode activations and support access grants.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (- View the log at Settings > Security > Audit Log.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (- Filter by user, event type, site and date range.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (- Export to CSV \(up to 100,000 rows per export\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 495 Td (- Audit events are retained for 400 days on both plans.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 482 Td (Enterprise tenants can additionally stream audit events to a SIEM through a webhook) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 469 Td (subscription with the event type "audit.*".) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 444 Td (14. Data exports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (Bulk historical data should be extracted using export jobs rather than repeated calls to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (readings endpoint. Exports can be created in the portal at Reports > Exports > New Export or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (through the API with POST /v2/exports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (- An export job can cover at most 31 days of raw readings, or 12 months of hourly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (   aggregates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 348 Td (- Output formats: CSV \(gzip compressed\) or Parquet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 335 Td (- Completed export files are available for download for 7 days, after which they are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 322 Td (   deleted.) Tj ET
