BT /F2 11 Tf 54 562 Td (18.1 Dashboards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (Every site has a default dashboard showing asset health by ISO 10816-3 zone, active alarms,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 527 Td (gateway status and nodes with low battery. Users with the Analyst role or higher can create) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514 Td (additional dashboards at Dashboards > New Dashboard. A dashboard can contain up to 24 widgets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 501 Td (Available widget types are trend chart, zone heat map, alarm list, spectrum viewer \(Enterprise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 488 Td (only\), fleet status and KPI tile.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (Dashboards can be private, shared with a site, or shared tenant-wide. Tenant-wide dashboards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 453 Td (can only be published by a Tenant Owner. Dashboards shared with a site are visible to Viewers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 440 Td (of that site, which makes them the preferred way to give operators a read-only overview.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 417 Td (18.2 Scheduled reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395 Td (Scheduled reports deliver a PDF summary by email. They are configured at Reports > Scheduled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 382 Td (Reports > New Report. Options include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 360 Td (- Frequency: daily, weekly \(choose the weekday\) or monthly \(first working day\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347 Td (- Delivery time: in the site's time zone; the default is 07:00.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 334 Td (- Content: asset health summary, alarms opened and closed in the period, top 10 assets by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 321 Td (   velocity RMS change, and node battery forecast.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 308 Td (- Recipients: up to 25 email addresses, which do not need to be TesseraCloud users.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 295 Td (A tenant can have at most 50 active scheduled reports. Reports that fail to generate for three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282 Td (consecutive runs are paused automatically and the report owner is notified.) Tj ET
